253
00:18:10,920 --> 00:18:13,567
And then your friends
became my friends, too.

254
00:18:14,300 --> 00:18:16,124
I never thought of it that way.

255
00:18:16,440 --> 00:18:17,381
Well, it's true.

256
00:18:17,780 --> 00:18:22,309
Besides, you're about to do something
for me that I could never do on my own.

257
00:18:22,580 --> 00:18:26,260
Regain my memory and unlock
the mysteries of my past.

258
00:18:26,540 --> 00:18:28,420
