264
00:18:47,700 --> 00:18:50,240
Oh, no! Go! He's awake!

265
00:18:50,420 --> 00:18:51,260
Run for it!

266
00:18:52,420 --> 00:18:53,250
Stop!

267
00:18:53,960 --> 00:18:54,960
Come on!

268
00:18:56,220 --> 00:18:57,240
