270
00:19:02,800 --> 00:19:07,153
If that bag falls into the wrong hands,
the whole world could be in danger

271
00:19:14,080 --> 00:19:18,040
That was a joke I gotta
have a look at these things

272
00:19:20,320 --> 00:19:24,120
Hey, wait a sec Those
