273
00:19:35,460 --> 00:19:40,657
who's there it hasn't
been that long has it i

274
00:19:40,740 --> 00:19:43,720
know you you used to tag
along with yugi right

275
00:19:44,400 --> 00:19:47,937
listen pal you better not
be after those god cards

276
00:19:48,020 --> 00:19:52,540
i already have what i'm
